+	 discouraging them and fairly narrowly when encouraging. Take into
+	 account the typical terrain of a civ when deciding which resources
+	 are worth discouraging; this is mostly a matter of keeping this file
+	 readable. Encourage only resources that are very typical for a civ.
+	 I've in fact picked just exactly two for each civ. Not sure if that
+	 restriction really makes sense. Avoid encouraging resources required
+	 for early uniques; don't want players to be able to rely on those
+	 (too powerful that way). -->
